      <span class="exp-preview-title" data-en="UTBM — Engineering" data-fr="UTBM — Ingénierie">UTBM — Engineering</span>
      <span class="exp-preview-flag">🇫🇷</span>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <!-- Full content (opened in overlay) -->
  <template class="cell-full">
    <p class="overlay-section-title" data-en="02 / EXPERIENCE" data-fr="02 / EXPÉRIENCE">02 / EXPERIENCE</p>
    <h2 class="overlay-heading" data-en="Experience" data-fr="Expérience">Experience</h2>

    <div class="overlay-timeline">

      <!-- UQAC -->
      <div class="overlay-exp-item">
        <div class="overlay-exp-date">
          <span data-en="sept 2025 — aug 2026" data-fr="sept 2025 — août 2026">sept 2025 — aug 2026</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="overlay-exp-title">
            <span data-en="Double Degree — Master in Artificial Intelligence" data-fr="Double Diplôme — Master en Intelligence Artificielle">Double Degree — Master in Artificial Intelligence</span>
            <span>🇨🇦</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="overlay-exp-company" data-en="University of Quebec at Chicoutimi (UQAC)" data-fr="Université du Québec à Chicoutimi (UQAC)">University of Quebec at Chicoutimi (UQAC)</p>
          <p class="overlay-text"
             data-en="Advanced master's program in artificial intelligence with focus on cutting-edge techniques:"
             data-fr="Programme de master avancé en intelligence artificielle avec focus sur les techniques de pointe :">
            Advanced master's program in artificial intelligence with focus on cutting-edge techniques:
          </p>
          <ul class="overlay-list">
            <li data-en="Deep Neural Networks: architectures and optimization" data-fr="Réseaux de Neurones Profonds : architectures et optimisation">Deep Neural Networks: architectures and optimization</li>
            <li data-en="Metaheuristics: genetic algorithms, particle swarm, simulated annealing" data-fr="Métaheuristiques : algorithmes génétiques, essaims particulaires, recuit simulé">Metaheuristics: genetic algorithms, particle swarm, simulated annealing</li>
            <li data-en="Generative AI: GANs, VAEs, Diffusion Models" data-fr="IA Générative : GANs, VAEs, Modèles de Diffusion">Generative AI: GANs, VAEs, Diffusion Models</li>
            <li data-en="Teaching Assistant: supervised practical sessions for introductory C++ programming course" data-fr="Auxiliaire d'enseignement : encadrement de travaux pratiques pour un cours d'initiation au C++">Teaching Assistant: supervised practical sessions for introductory C++ programming course</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="overlay-divider"></div>

      <!-- AnotherBrain -->
      <div class="overlay-exp-item">
        <div class="overlay-exp-date">
          <span data-en="sept 2024 — feb 2025" data-fr="sept 2024 — fev 2025">sept 2024 — feb 2025</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="overlay-exp-title">
            <span data-en="Research Intern — Bio-inspired Motion Detection" data-fr="Stagiaire Recherche — Détection de mouvement bio-inspirée">Research Intern — Bio-inspired Motion Detection</span>
            <span>🇫🇷</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="overlay-exp-company">AnotherBrain</p>

          <div class="overlay-subsection">
            <p class="overlay-subsection-label" data-en="Problem" data-fr="Problème">Problem</p>
            <p class="overlay-text"
               data-en="Segment moving objects in video streams without deep neural networks, for low-power embedded systems (neuromorphic computing)."
               data-fr="Segmenter des objets en mouvement dans un flux vidéo sans réseaux de neurones profonds, pour des systèmes embarqués à faible consommation (neuromorphique).">
              Segment moving objects in video streams without deep neural networks, for low-power embedded systems (neuromorphic computing).
            </p>
            <p class="overlay-text"
               data-en="Why naive approaches fail: background subtraction fails on dynamic backgrounds; deep detectors (YOLO, Mask R-CNN) too expensive for edge; frame difference generates excessive false positives."
               data-fr="Pourquoi les approches naïves échouent : la soustraction de fond échoue sur les fonds dynamiques ; les détecteurs deep (YOLO, Mask R-CNN) trop coûteux pour l'edge ; la différence d'images génère trop de faux positifs.">
              Why naive approaches fail: background subtraction fails on dynamic backgrounds; deep detectors (YOLO, Mask R-CNN) too expensive for edge; frame difference generates excessive false positives.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="overlay-subsection">
            <p class="overlay-subsection-label" data-en="Technical Approach" data-fr="Approche technique">Technical Approach</p>
            <p class="overlay-text"
               data-en="Hypothesis: local entropy measured over a spatio-temporal window isolates moving regions without supervised learning. Based on Ma & Zhang (STEI, 2001) and Guo Jing (DSTEI, 2004)."
               data-fr="Hypothèse : l'entropie locale mesurée sur une fenêtre spatio-temporelle permet d'isoler les régions en mouvement sans apprentissage supervisé. Basé sur Ma & Zhang (STEI, 2001) et Guo Jing (DSTEI, 2004).">
              Hypothesis: local entropy measured over a spatio-temporal window isolates moving regions without supervised learning. Based on Ma & Zhang (STEI, 2001) and Guo Jing (DSTEI, 2004).
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="overlay-subsection">
            <p class="overlay-subsection-label" data-en="Implementation" data-fr="Implémentation">Implementation</p>
            <div class="tech-badges">
              <span class="tech-badge">Python</span>
              <span class="tech-badge">CuPy (GPU kernels)</span>
              <span class="tech-badge">cProfile / nvprof</span>
            </div>
            <p class="overlay-text"
               data-en="Constraints: real-time target (>15 FPS on mid-range GPU), limited memory (no full history storage)."
               data-fr="Contraintes : temps réel visé (>15 FPS sur GPU mid-range), mémoire limitée (pas de stockage de l'historique complet).">
              Constraints: real-time target (>15 FPS on mid-range GPU), limited memory (no full history storage).
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="overlay-subsection">
            <p class="overlay-subsection-label" data-en="Results" data-fr="Résultats">Results</p>
            <div class="metrics-row">
              <div class="metric-item">
                <span class="metric-value">×12</span>
                <span class="metric-label" data-en="GPU vs CPU speedup" data-fr="Speedup GPU vs CPU">GPU vs CPU speedup</span>
              </div>
              <div class="metric-item">
                <span class="metric-value">~0.72</span>
                <span class="metric-label" data-en="IoU (multi-object)" data-fr="IoU (multi-objets)">IoU (multi-object)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="metric-item">
                <span class="metric-value">45ms</span>
                <span class="metric-label" data-en="Latency / frame (RTX 2080 Ti)" data-fr="Latence / frame (RTX 2080 Ti)">Latency / frame (RTX 2080 Ti)</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="overlay-imgs">
            <div>
              <img src="/assets/fram3.png" alt="Motion detection frame 1" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div>
              <img src="/assets/frame33.png" alt="Motion detection frame 2" loading="lazy">
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="overlay-img-caption"
             data-en="Segmentation of multiple objects in motion without deep learning (bio-inspired approach)"
             data-fr="Segmentation de plusieurs objets en mouvement sans deep learning (approche bio-inspirée)">
            Segmentation of multiple objects in motion without deep learning (bio-inspired approach)
          </p>

          <div class="overlay-subsection">
            <p class="overlay-subsection-label" data-en="Engineering Decisions" data-fr="Décisions d'ingénierie">Engineering Decisions</p>
            <ul class="overlay-list">
              <li data-en="Precision vs latency: reduced temporal window (5→3 frames) to meet latency budget" data-fr="Précision vs latence : réduction de la fenêtre temporelle (5→3 frames) pour tenir le budget latence">Precision vs latency: reduced temporal window (5→3 frames) to meet latency budget</li>
              <li data-en="Memory vs quality: sliding block computation instead of full image processing" data-fr="Mémoire vs qualité : calcul par blocs glissants plutôt que sur l'image entière">Memory vs quality: sliding block computation instead of full image processing</li>
              <li data-en="Fixed parameters vs adaptive: 20% latency gain with fixed params" data-fr="Paramètres fixes vs adaptatifs : gain de 20% en latence avec paramètres fixes">Fixed parameters vs adaptive: 20% latency gain with fixed params</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="overlay-imgs">
            <div>
              <img src="/assets/pipe_frame73.png" alt="Human feature extraction" loading="lazy">
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="overlay-img-caption"
             data-en="Human feature extraction (bio-inspired algorithm)"
             data-fr="Extraction de caractéristiques d'un humain (algorithme bio-inspiré)">
            Human feature extraction (bio-inspired algorithm)
          </p>

          <div class="overlay-subsection">
            <p class="overlay-subsection-label" data-en="Industrial Context Improvements" data-fr="Améliorations en contexte industriel">Industrial Context Improvements</p>
            <ul class="overlay-list">
              <li data-en="Automated benchmark with CI/CD for performance regression detection" data-fr="Benchmark automatisé avec CI/CD pour détecter les régressions de performance">Automated benchmark with CI/CD for performance regression detection</li>
              <li data-en="More systematic hyperparameter tuning for temporal window size" data-fr="Tuning plus systématique des hyperparamètres pour la taille de fenêtre temporelle">More systematic hyperparameter tuning for temporal window size</li>
              <li data-en="Quantitative comparison with classical background subtraction methods (MOG2, KNN)" data-fr="Comparaison quantitative avec les méthodes classiques de soustraction de fond (MOG2, KNN)">Quantitative comparison with classical background subtraction methods (MOG2, KNN)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="overlay-divider"></div>

      <!-- AGH Erasmus -->
      <div class="overlay-exp-item">
        <div class="overlay-exp-date">
          <span data-en="feb 2023 — jul 2023" data-fr="fev 2023 — juil 2023">feb 2023 — jul 2023</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="overlay-exp-title">
            <span data-en="Erasmus Exchange Student" data-fr="Étudiant Erasmus">Erasmus Exchange Student</span>
            <span>🇵🇱</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="overlay-exp-company">AGH University of Science and Technology, Kraków</p>
          <p class="overlay-text"
             data-en="5-month international exchange focusing on medical imaging and biometrics:"
             data-fr="Échange international de 5 mois axé sur l'imagerie médicale et la biométrie :">
            5-month international exchange focusing on medical imaging and biometrics:
          </p>
          <ul class="overlay-list">
            <li data-en="Medical Image Analysis using Deep Learning" data-fr="Analyse d'Images Médicales par Deep Learning">Medical Image Analysis using Deep Learning</li>
            <li data-en="Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN) for image classification" data-fr="Réseaux de Neurones Convolutifs (CNN) pour la classification d'images">Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN) for image classification</li>
            <li data-en="Autoencoders for feature extraction and dimensionality reduction" data-fr="Autoencodeurs pour l'extraction de caractéristiques et la réduction de dimensionnalité">Autoencoders for feature extraction and dimensionality reduction</li>
            <li data-en="Generative models for medical image synthesis" data-fr="Modèles génératifs pour la synthèse d'images médicales">Generative models for medical image synthesis</li>
            <li data-en="Biometric Systems & Authentication" data-fr="Systèmes Biométriques & Authentification">Biometric Systems & Authentication</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="overlay-divider"></div>

      <!-- UTBM -->
      <div class="overlay-exp-item">
        <div class="overlay-exp-date">2021 — 2026</div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="overlay-exp-title">
            <span data-en="Engineering Student in Computer Science" data-fr="Étudiant Ingénieur en Informatique">Engineering Student in Computer Science</span>
            <span>🇫🇷</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="overlay-exp-company" data-en="UTBM — Virtual Worlds & Artificial Vision" data-fr="UTBM — Mondes Virtuels & Vision Artificielle">UTBM — Virtual Worlds & Artificial Vision</p>
          <ul class="overlay-list">
            <li data-en="Linear Algebra & Mathematical Analysis" data-fr="Algèbre Linéaire & Analyse Mathématique">Linear Algebra & Mathematical Analysis</li>
            <li data-en="Object-Oriented Programming" data-fr="Programmation Orientée Objet">Object-Oriented Programming</li>
            <li data-en="Fundamentals of Artificial Intelligence" data-fr="Fondamentaux de l'Intelligence Artificielle">Fundamentals of Artificial Intelligence</li>
            <li data-en="Computer Vision & Image Processing" data-fr="Vision par Ordinateur & Traitement d'Images">Computer Vision & Image Processing</li>
            <li data-en="Virtual Reality & 3D Graphics" data-fr="Réalité Virtuelle & Graphisme 3D">Virtual Reality & 3D Graphics</li>
            <li data-en="Student Tutor: provided academic support and mentoring to fellow students" data-fr="Tuteur étudiant : fourni soutien académique et mentorat aux autres étudiants">Student Tutor: provided academic support and mentoring to fellow students</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </template>
</div>
